Cell["\<\
The default stateFunction is Identity, so each sample produces a list of \
{energy, eigenvector} pairs.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->2025559560,ExpressionUUID->"12d794ae-e187-b442-9fcd-bf3fdb1697ae"],

Cell["\<\
stateFunction acts on each eigenvector; for example, Total[Abs[#]^4]& gives \
its inverse participation ratio when the state is normalized.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1850316322,ExpressionUUID->"15c2296b-60fe-af44-b0f0-b6d7483e818d"],

Cell["\<\
The output is grouped by sample, unlike the band-by-sample matrix returned by \
BandData.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1359621791,ExpressionUUID->"1e9fd559-8611-1046-a468-bf689687add2"],

Cell["\<\
To request n eigenpairs unambiguously, provide the state function explicitly \
before n. Eigensystem options are accepted and Method -> \"Direct\" is \
supplied internally.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->553064422,ExpressionUUID->"56ac33d8-406f-9641-9db8-2d603542d242"]
}, Closed]],

